{"v":1,"book":"gita","n":17,"title":"Threefold faith","hosts":[{"id":"A","name":"Ava","voice":"en-US-AvaMultilingualNeural"},{"id":"B","name":"Andrew","voice":"en-US-AndrewMultilingualNeural"}],"duration":416.736,"segments":[{"title":"Welcome","start":0.0},{"title":"The story","start":26.424},{"title":"Lesson 1 · You are your faith","start":279.864},{"title":"Lesson 2 · Everything in three modes","start":302.736},{"title":"Lesson 3 · Deed, word, thought","start":336.12},{"title":"Lesson 4 · Without faith, nothing","start":366.384},{"title":"Wrap-up","start":387.864}],"turns":[{"s":"A","start":0.0,"end":2.832,"text":"Welcome to Shruti. I'm Ava.","L":[],"words":[[0.087,0.537,"Welcome"],[0.637,0.138,"to"],[0.787,0.5,"Shruti"],[1.663,0.275,"I'm"],[1.938,0.525,"Ava"]]},{"s":"B","start":3.12,"end":7.872,"text":"And I'm Andrew. Today, Chapter Seventeen: Threefold Faith.","L":[],"words":[[0.1,0.1,"And"],[0.325,0.163,"I'm"],[0.487,0.463,"Andrew"],[1.363,0.263,"Today"],[1.675,0.45,"Chapter"],[2.125,0.762,"Seventeen"],[3.263,0.6,"Threefold"],[3.875,0.512,"Faith"]]},{"s":"A","start":8.16,"end":22.848,"text":"Chapter Fourteen introduced the three modes: goodness, passion and inertia. This chapter applies them to everyday life: your faith, your food, how you give, how you discipline yourself, even how you speak.","L":[],"words":[[0.113,0.438,"Chapter"],[0.562,0.512,"Fourteen"],[1.087,0.613,"introduced"],[1.712,0.087,"the"],[1.812,0.35,"three"],[2.163,0.475,"modes"],[3.075,0.5,"goodness"],[3.925,0.662,"passion"],[4.713,0.188,"and"],[4.975,0.537,"inertia"],[5.888,0.2,"This"],[6.1,0.412,"chapter"],[6.525,0.412,"applies"],[6.938,0.212,"them"],[7.162,0.225,"to"],[7.4,0.425,"everyday"],[7.838,0.425,"life"],[8.775,0.125,"your"],[8.912,0.475,"faith"],[9.575,0.138,"your"],[9.725,0.5,"food"],[10.475,0.075,"how"],[10.562,0.163,"you"],[10.738,0.388,"give"],[11.562,0.075,"how"],[11.65,0.163,"you"],[11.825,0.412,"discipline"],[12.25,0.55,"yourself"],[13.25,0.2,"even"],[13.463,0.175,"how"],[13.65,0.125,"you"],[13.787,0.525,"speak"]]},{"s":"B","start":23.136,"end":25.56,"text":"Four lessons. Story first.","L":[],"words":[[0.15,0.087,"Four"],[0.25,0.562,"lessons"],[1.225,0.3,"Story"],[1.538,0.512,"first"]]},{"s":"A","start":26.424,"end":42.168,"text":"Chapter Sixteen ended by telling Arjuna to follow scripture. So he asks a fair question, seventeen point one: what about people who practice with faith, but without following the scriptures? Is that goodness, passion, or ignorance?","L":[],"words":[[0.113,0.4,"Chapter"],[0.525,0.575,"Sixteen"],[1.15,0.35,"ended"],[1.512,0.15,"by"],[1.675,0.375,"telling"],[2.05,0.625,"Arjuna"],[2.775,0.113,"to"],[2.9,0.3,"follow"],[3.212,0.562,"scripture"],[4.188,0.388,"So"],[4.737,0.212,"he"],[4.963,0.3,"asks"],[5.275,0.062,"a"],[5.35,0.237,"fair"],[5.6,0.525,"question"],[6.375,0.625,"seventeen"],[7.013,0.263,"point"],[7.287,0.225,"one"],[8.062,0.087,"what"],[8.162,0.188,"about"],[8.363,0.275,"people"],[8.65,0.087,"who"],[8.75,0.412,"practice"],[9.175,0.113,"with"],[9.3,0.412,"faith"],[9.975,0.275,"but"],[10.387,0.338,"without"],[10.738,0.4,"following"],[11.15,0.062,"the"],[11.225,0.637,"scriptures"],[12.25,0.125,"Is"],[12.375,0.237,"that"],[12.613,0.588,"goodness"],[13.463,0.65,"passion"],[14.475,0.2,"or"],[14.738,0.65,"ignorance"]]},{"s":"B","start":42.456,"end":51.888,"text":"Krishna, seventeen point two: the natural faith of embodied beings is of three kinds, goodness, passion and ignorance.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.1,0.512,"Krishna"],[0.875,0.613,"seventeen"],[1.488,0.35,"point"],[1.837,0.412,"two"],[2.763,0.075,"the"],[2.837,0.412,"natural"],[3.263,0.362,"faith"],[3.638,0.075,"of"],[3.725,0.487,"embodied"],[4.213,0.438,"beings"],[4.662,0.188,"is"],[4.862,0.113,"of"],[4.987,0.537,"three"],[5.537,0.613,"kinds"],[6.537,0.613,"goodness"],[7.35,0.613,"passion"],[8.125,0.175,"and"],[8.4,0.662,"ignorance"]]},{"s":"A","start":52.176,"end":68.712,"text":"And then a profound line, seventeen point three: the faith of each is in accordance with one's own nature. One is known by one's faith. One can become whatever one wants to be, if one constantly contemplates the object of desire with faith.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.1,0.125,"And"],[0.237,0.188,"then"],[0.425,0.05,"a"],[0.487,0.6,"profound"],[1.1,0.4,"line"],[1.925,0.588,"seventeen"],[2.525,0.275,"point"],[2.8,0.375,"three"],[3.763,0.1,"the"],[3.875,0.362,"faith"],[4.237,0.113,"of"],[4.438,0.375,"each"],[4.9,0.1,"is"],[5.013,0.062,"in"],[5.088,0.613,"accordance"],[5.825,0.125,"with"],[5.963,0.362,"one's"],[6.338,0.2,"own"],[6.55,0.525,"nature"],[7.45,0.237,"One"],[7.7,0.125,"is"],[7.838,0.35,"known"],[8.2,0.175,"by"],[8.387,0.4,"one's"],[8.787,0.463,"faith"],[9.637,0.287,"One"],[9.938,0.25,"can"],[10.2,0.412,"become"],[10.625,0.388,"whatever"],[11.025,0.188,"one"],[11.225,0.237,"wants"],[11.463,0.087,"to"],[11.562,0.312,"be"],[12.325,0.15,"if"],[12.488,0.312,"one"],[12.8,0.588,"constantly"],[13.4,0.688,"contemplates"],[14.1,0.138,"the"],[14.3,0.512,"object"],[14.825,0.113,"of"],[14.95,0.55,"desire"],[15.512,0.163,"with"],[15.675,0.512,"faith"]]},{"s":"B","start":69.0,"end":72.816,"text":"You become what you put your faith in. That's a sentence to sit with.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.1,0.1,"You"],[0.2,0.325,"become"],[0.525,0.113,"what"],[0.637,0.113,"you"],[0.762,0.212,"put"],[0.975,0.125,"your"],[1.1,0.388,"faith"],[1.488,0.225,"in"],[2.138,0.138,"That's"],[2.288,0.05,"a"],[2.35,0.463,"sentence"],[2.812,0.075,"to"],[2.888,0.25,"sit"],[3.15,0.3,"with"]]},{"s":"A","start":73.104,"end":84.288,"text":"Seventeen point four: those in goodness worship the divine powers; those in passion worship powerful beings and demons; those in ignorance worship ghosts and spirits.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.087,0.487,"Seventeen"],[0.575,0.237,"point"],[0.825,0.312,"four"],[1.738,0.237,"those"],[1.988,0.113,"in"],[2.112,0.425,"goodness"],[2.55,0.4,"worship"],[2.962,0.05,"the"],[3.025,0.388,"divine"],[3.425,0.537,"powers"],[4.45,0.263,"those"],[4.725,0.125,"in"],[4.862,0.525,"passion"],[5.4,0.412,"worship"],[5.825,0.537,"powerful"],[6.375,0.5,"beings"],[6.875,0.212,"and"],[7.1,0.512,"demons"],[8.137,0.263,"those"],[8.412,0.087,"in"],[8.512,0.487,"ignorance"],[9.012,0.412,"worship"],[9.425,0.463,"ghosts"],[9.9,0.212,"and"],[10.125,0.688,"spirits"]]},{"s":"B","start":84.576,"end":100.848,"text":"And a warning against extreme self-punishment, seventeen point five and six: those who practice severe austerities not prescribed by scripture, full of hypocrisy and ego, senselessly torture the body, and Me who dwells within it.","L":["L3"],"words":[[0.1,0.1,"And"],[0.212,0.075,"a"],[0.3,0.537,"warning"],[0.838,0.4,"against"],[1.238,0.762,"extreme"],[2.125,0.787,"self-punishment"],[3.2,0.625,"seventeen"],[3.825,0.338,"point"],[4.162,0.412,"five"],[4.575,0.1,"and"],[4.688,0.662,"six"],[5.862,0.225,"those"],[6.088,0.113,"who"],[6.2,0.512,"practice"],[6.713,0.5,"severe"],[7.213,0.7,"austerities"],[7.925,0.287,"not"],[8.213,0.525,"prescribed"],[8.738,0.113,"by"],[8.85,0.55,"scripture"],[9.825,0.263,"full"],[10.088,0.075,"of"],[10.162,0.775,"hypocrisy"],[10.95,0.188,"and"],[11.262,0.45,"ego"],[12.15,0.688,"senselessly"],[12.838,0.425,"torture"],[13.262,0.075,"the"],[13.35,0.412,"body"],[14.137,0.125,"and"],[14.275,0.312,"Me"],[14.588,0.175,"who"],[14.775,0.613,"dwells"],[15.387,0.35,"within"],[15.738,0.175,"it"]]},{"s":"A","start":101.136,"end":115.704,"text":"Then food. Seventeen point eight: foods that promote longevity, virtue, strength, health, happiness and joy, that are juicy, smooth, substantial and nutritious, are liked by people in goodness.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.087,0.2,"Then"],[0.3,0.438,"food"],[1.137,0.525,"Seventeen"],[1.675,0.25,"point"],[1.938,0.275,"eight"],[2.763,0.375,"foods"],[3.138,0.175,"that"],[3.325,0.4,"promote"],[3.737,0.613,"longevity"],[4.75,0.45,"virtue"],[5.463,0.5,"strength"],[6.312,0.287,"health"],[6.975,0.463,"happiness"],[7.45,0.175,"and"],[7.638,0.412,"joy"],[8.425,0.1,"that"],[8.537,0.1,"are"],[8.65,0.6,"juicy"],[9.525,0.5,"smooth"],[10.425,0.85,"substantial"],[11.287,0.1,"and"],[11.4,0.65,"nutritious"],[12.412,0.138,"are"],[12.55,0.325,"liked"],[12.887,0.15,"by"],[13.05,0.425,"people"],[13.488,0.113,"in"],[13.6,0.613,"goodness"]]},{"s":"B","start":115.992,"end":127.104,"text":"Seventeen point nine: people in passion like foods that are very bitter, sour, salty, hot, pungent, dry and burning, which cause pain, grief and disease.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.1,0.487,"Seventeen"],[0.6,0.263,"point"],[0.863,0.35,"nine"],[1.762,0.275,"people"],[2.038,0.075,"in"],[2.125,0.438,"passion"],[2.562,0.138,"like"],[2.712,0.4,"foods"],[3.112,0.087,"that"],[3.2,0.05,"are"],[3.263,0.362,"very"],[3.638,0.4,"bitter"],[4.287,0.613,"sour"],[5.125,0.6,"salty"],[5.963,0.388,"hot"],[6.588,0.487,"pungent"],[7.237,0.325,"dry"],[7.562,0.1,"and"],[7.675,0.425,"burning"],[8.325,0.138,"which"],[8.463,0.287,"cause"],[8.75,0.475,"pain"],[9.463,0.487,"grief"],[10.025,0.075,"and"],[10.113,0.637,"disease"]]},{"s":"A","start":127.392,"end":138.216,"text":"And seventeen point ten, in our book's words: people in ignorance like foods that are stale, tasteless, putrid, rotten, impure, such as meat and alcohol.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.1,0.237,"And"],[0.35,0.575,"seventeen"],[0.938,0.263,"point"],[1.212,0.375,"ten"],[1.812,0.125,"in"],[1.95,0.125,"our"],[2.075,0.25,"book's"],[2.337,0.438,"words"],[3.212,0.275,"people"],[3.5,0.075,"in"],[3.587,0.463,"ignorance"],[4.062,0.225,"like"],[4.287,0.438,"foods"],[4.725,0.1,"that"],[4.838,0.087,"are"],[4.938,0.575,"stale"],[5.763,0.613,"tasteless"],[6.65,0.537,"putrid"],[7.425,0.4,"rotten"],[8.025,0.575,"impure"],[8.787,0.212,"such"],[9.012,0.138,"as"],[9.15,0.425,"meat"],[9.662,0.163,"and"],[9.838,0.625,"alcohol"]]},{"s":"B","start":138.504,"end":158.088,"text":"Then sacrifice, or selfless service, in three modes. Seventeen point eleven: done as duty, without desire for the fruit, it's goodness. Done for show and for reward, passion. Done carelessly, without faith, without sharing food, ignorance.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.1,0.175,"Then"],[0.275,0.912,"sacrifice"],[1.4,0.163,"or"],[1.575,0.525,"selfless"],[2.1,0.6,"service"],[2.938,0.138,"in"],[3.087,0.275,"three"],[3.362,0.575,"modes"],[4.35,0.662,"Seventeen"],[5.013,0.4,"point"],[5.487,0.438,"eleven"],[6.475,0.338,"done"],[6.812,0.287,"as"],[7.162,0.5,"duty"],[8.062,0.325,"without"],[8.4,0.5,"desire"],[8.912,0.087,"for"],[9.0,0.062,"the"],[9.062,0.438,"fruit"],[9.9,0.125,"it's"],[10.025,0.688,"goodness"],[11.113,0.2,"Done"],[11.312,0.125,"for"],[11.438,0.487,"show"],[12.037,0.138,"and"],[12.175,0.188,"for"],[12.375,0.562,"reward"],[13.137,0.588,"passion"],[14.137,0.3,"Done"],[14.45,0.775,"carelessly"],[15.588,0.375,"without"],[15.975,0.613,"faith"],[16.812,0.388,"without"],[17.212,0.425,"sharing"],[17.637,0.525,"food"],[18.587,0.625,"ignorance"]]},{"s":"A","start":158.376,"end":172.344,"text":"Then a beautiful passage on three kinds of austerity. Seventeen point fourteen, austerity of deed: worship of the divine and the wise, purity, honesty, self-restraint, and nonviolence.","L":["L3"],"words":[[0.075,0.2,"Then"],[0.287,0.087,"a"],[0.388,0.45,"beautiful"],[0.85,0.613,"passage"],[1.525,0.25,"on"],[1.788,0.375,"three"],[2.175,0.325,"kinds"],[2.5,0.075,"of"],[2.587,0.637,"austerity"],[3.625,0.575,"Seventeen"],[4.213,0.237,"point"],[4.45,0.6,"fourteen"],[5.463,0.575,"austerity"],[6.05,0.1,"of"],[6.162,0.362,"deed"],[7.112,0.4,"worship"],[7.525,0.087,"of"],[7.625,0.062,"the"],[7.688,0.6,"divine"],[8.3,0.087,"and"],[8.4,0.1,"the"],[8.5,0.55,"wise"],[9.475,0.5,"purity"],[10.488,0.55,"honesty"],[11.425,0.887,"self-restraint"],[12.475,0.163,"and"],[12.65,0.938,"nonviolence"]]},{"s":"B","start":172.632,"end":182.736,"text":"Seventeen point fifteen, austerity of word: speech that is non-offensive, truthful, pleasant and beneficial, and the regular study of scripture.","L":["L3"],"words":[[0.1,0.463,"Seventeen"],[0.562,0.275,"point"],[0.85,0.7,"fifteen"],[1.988,0.613,"austerity"],[2.6,0.087,"of"],[2.688,0.35,"word"],[3.5,0.388,"speech"],[3.9,0.125,"that"],[4.037,0.1,"is"],[4.138,0.925,"non-offensive"],[5.362,0.725,"truthful"],[6.362,0.537,"pleasant"],[7.0,0.087,"and"],[7.088,0.775,"beneficial"],[8.287,0.037,"and"],[8.325,0.087,"the"],[8.412,0.388,"regular"],[8.812,0.312,"study"],[9.125,0.05,"of"],[9.175,0.575,"scripture"]]},{"s":"A","start":183.024,"end":190.728,"text":"Truthful and pleasant and beneficial. All three at once. That's a high bar for every conversation.","L":["L3"],"words":[[0.087,0.65,"Truthful"],[0.75,0.125,"and"],[0.887,0.537,"pleasant"],[1.688,0.15,"and"],[1.85,0.688,"beneficial"],[2.925,0.338,"All"],[3.275,0.438,"three"],[3.725,0.163,"at"],[3.9,0.537,"once"],[4.825,0.25,"That's"],[5.075,0.05,"a"],[5.138,0.338,"high"],[5.487,0.35,"bar"],[5.838,0.263,"for"],[6.275,0.275,"every"],[6.562,0.787,"conversation"]]},{"s":"B","start":191.016,"end":200.712,"text":"Seventeen point sixteen, austerity of thought: serenity of mind, gentleness, calmness, self-control, and purity of thought.","L":["L3"],"words":[[0.1,0.5,"Seventeen"],[0.6,0.25,"point"],[0.85,0.675,"sixteen"],[1.863,0.713,"austerity"],[2.575,0.075,"of"],[2.65,0.487,"thought"],[3.587,0.588,"serenity"],[4.175,0.062,"of"],[4.237,0.55,"mind"],[5.138,0.675,"gentleness"],[6.0,0.637,"calmness"],[6.85,0.912,"self-control"],[8.188,0.062,"and"],[8.25,0.5,"purity"],[8.75,0.075,"of"],[8.825,0.487,"thought"]]},{"s":"A","start":201.0,"end":215.376,"text":"And those austerities also come in three modes. With faith and no desire for reward, goodness. For respect and show, passion. With stubbornness, self-torture or to harm others, ignorance.","L":["L2","L3"],"words":[[0.1,0.15,"And"],[0.263,0.237,"those"],[0.512,0.675,"austerities"],[1.2,0.35,"also"],[1.562,0.263,"come"],[1.837,0.15,"in"],[2.0,0.287,"three"],[2.288,0.588,"modes"],[3.25,0.188,"With"],[3.45,0.438,"faith"],[3.95,0.188,"and"],[4.15,0.175,"no"],[4.338,0.487,"desire"],[4.825,0.163,"for"],[5.0,0.537,"reward"],[5.925,0.637,"goodness"],[7.025,0.163,"For"],[7.188,0.562,"respect"],[7.825,0.138,"and"],[7.975,0.475,"show"],[8.725,0.562,"passion"],[9.662,0.163,"With"],[9.838,0.637,"stubbornness"],[10.85,0.875,"self-torture"],[11.738,0.2,"or"],[11.95,0.087,"to"],[12.05,0.362,"harm"],[12.488,0.475,"others"],[13.375,0.65,"ignorance"]]},{"s":"B","start":215.664,"end":240.264,"text":"Then charity. Seventeen point twenty: given as a duty, at the right place and time, to a deserving person who gives nothing back, it's goodness. Seventeen point twenty-one: given unwillingly, or to get something back, passion. Seventeen point twenty-two: given at the wrong place and time, to the unworthy, or with disrespect, ignorance.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.1,0.25,"Then"],[0.5,0.55,"charity"],[1.438,0.6,"Seventeen"],[2.038,0.3,"point"],[2.35,0.45,"twenty"],[3.3,0.275,"given"],[3.575,0.125,"as"],[3.7,0.075,"a"],[3.775,0.525,"duty"],[4.487,0.087,"at"],[4.575,0.075,"the"],[4.65,0.362,"right"],[5.013,0.438,"place"],[5.463,0.087,"and"],[5.55,0.5,"time"],[6.3,0.15,"to"],[6.45,0.062,"a"],[6.525,0.55,"deserving"],[7.088,0.512,"person"],[7.75,0.125,"who"],[7.888,0.275,"gives"],[8.162,0.425,"nothing"],[8.6,0.537,"back"],[9.375,0.163,"it's"],[9.55,0.713,"goodness"],[10.662,0.475,"Seventeen"],[11.137,0.237,"point"],[11.375,0.562,"twenty-one"],[12.35,0.312,"given"],[12.675,0.912,"unwillingly"],[14.012,0.1,"or"],[14.113,0.062,"to"],[14.175,0.15,"get"],[14.325,0.312,"something"],[14.637,0.525,"back"],[15.363,0.625,"passion"],[16.387,0.562,"Seventeen"],[16.95,0.275,"point"],[17.225,0.75,"twenty-two"],[18.413,0.237,"given"],[18.65,0.062,"at"],[18.712,0.087,"the"],[18.8,0.4,"wrong"],[19.212,0.375,"place"],[19.587,0.087,"and"],[19.688,0.5,"time"],[20.587,0.1,"to"],[20.688,0.138,"the"],[20.837,0.762,"unworthy"],[22.087,0.1,"or"],[22.188,0.175,"with"],[22.363,0.838,"disrespect"],[23.6,0.637,"ignorance"]]},{"s":"A","start":240.552,"end":249.408,"text":"Then the chapter ends with three sacred words. Seventeen point twenty-three: Om Tat Sat is said to be the threefold name of God.","L":[],"words":[[0.087,0.113,"Then"],[0.2,0.062,"the"],[0.275,0.637,"chapter"],[0.925,0.3,"ends"],[1.238,0.188,"with"],[1.438,0.388,"three"],[1.837,0.4,"sacred"],[2.25,0.55,"words"],[3.188,0.6,"Seventeen"],[3.8,0.287,"point"],[4.088,0.562,"twenty-three"],[5.275,0.3,"Om"],[5.588,0.287,"Tat"],[5.875,0.3,"Sat"],[6.188,0.1,"is"],[6.3,0.287,"said"],[6.6,0.062,"to"],[6.662,0.125,"be"],[6.8,0.113,"the"],[6.925,0.725,"threefold"],[7.662,0.275,"name"],[7.95,0.087,"of"],[8.05,0.45,"God"]]},{"s":"B","start":249.696,"end":265.416,"text":"Om begins every sacred act. Tat, meaning that, or He is all, is said when acting without seeking a reward. And Sat means reality and goodness, and is used for any auspicious act, and for faith itself.","L":[],"words":[[0.1,0.188,"Om"],[0.287,0.625,"begins"],[1.087,0.275,"every"],[1.363,0.4,"sacred"],[1.775,0.375,"act"],[2.55,0.35,"Tat"],[3.35,0.325,"meaning"],[3.688,0.35,"that"],[4.5,0.163,"or"],[4.662,0.25,"He"],[4.912,0.163,"is"],[5.075,0.325,"all"],[5.825,0.125,"is"],[5.95,0.275,"said"],[6.225,0.2,"when"],[6.438,0.4,"acting"],[6.838,0.338,"without"],[7.175,0.487,"seeking"],[7.675,0.05,"a"],[7.737,0.525,"reward"],[8.675,0.125,"And"],[8.8,0.287,"Sat"],[9.088,0.35,"means"],[9.438,0.725,"reality"],[10.175,0.175,"and"],[10.363,0.65,"goodness"],[11.4,0.1,"and"],[11.5,0.113,"is"],[11.613,0.275,"used"],[11.887,0.212,"for"],[12.238,0.25,"any"],[12.5,0.75,"auspicious"],[13.375,0.375,"act"],[14.2,0.062,"and"],[14.275,0.138,"for"],[14.412,0.312,"faith"],[14.738,0.625,"itself"]]},{"s":"A","start":265.704,"end":279.0,"text":"And the last verse, seventeen point twenty-eight: whatever is done without faith, whether sacrifice, charity, austerity or any other act, is called Asat. It has no value here or hereafter.","L":["L4"],"words":[[0.1,0.125,"And"],[0.237,0.075,"the"],[0.312,0.4,"last"],[0.725,0.388,"verse"],[1.363,0.588,"seventeen"],[1.962,0.25,"point"],[2.212,0.512,"twenty-eight"],[3.288,0.362,"whatever"],[3.663,0.15,"is"],[3.825,0.25,"done"],[4.088,0.325,"without"],[4.425,0.463,"faith"],[5.15,0.237,"whether"],[5.4,0.8,"sacrifice"],[6.412,0.525,"charity"],[7.088,0.725,"austerity"],[7.825,0.225,"or"],[8.062,0.2,"any"],[8.275,0.212,"other"],[8.5,0.312,"act"],[9.213,0.125,"is"],[9.35,0.263,"called"],[9.613,0.5,"Asat"],[10.525,0.062,"It"],[10.588,0.25,"has"],[10.85,0.263,"no"],[11.125,0.412,"value"],[11.55,0.45,"here"],[12.1,0.138,"or"],[12.25,0.7,"hereafter"]]},{"s":"B","start":279.864,"end":283.944,"text":"Lesson one: faith is shaped by one's dominant mode of nature.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.087,0.35,"Lesson"],[0.438,0.25,"one"],[1.238,0.35,"faith"],[1.6,0.087,"is"],[1.688,0.35,"shaped"],[2.038,0.125,"by"],[2.163,0.312,"one's"],[2.475,0.4,"dominant"],[2.888,0.263,"mode"],[3.163,0.062,"of"],[3.237,0.5,"nature"]]},{"s":"A","start":284.232,"end":295.368,"text":"Each person's natural faith reflects which mode rules them. Goodness turns toward God and the divine; passion toward power; ignorance toward ghosts and dark forces.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.087,0.263,"Each"],[0.362,0.475,"person's"],[0.85,0.487,"natural"],[1.35,0.35,"faith"],[1.7,0.487,"reflects"],[2.2,0.237,"which"],[2.45,0.25,"mode"],[2.712,0.275,"rules"],[3.0,0.312,"them"],[3.7,0.438,"Goodness"],[4.15,0.362,"turns"],[4.525,0.338,"toward"],[4.862,0.388,"God"],[5.263,0.113,"and"],[5.388,0.075,"the"],[5.475,0.575,"divine"],[6.475,0.5,"passion"],[6.987,0.263,"toward"],[7.263,0.475,"power"],[8.325,0.45,"ignorance"],[8.775,0.287,"toward"],[9.075,0.487,"ghosts"],[9.575,0.237,"and"],[9.825,0.275,"dark"],[10.113,0.65,"forces"]]},{"s":"B","start":295.656,"end":301.872,"text":"What you worship reveals your inner state. And what you keep contemplating with faith, you become.","L":["L1"],"words":[[0.1,0.125,"What"],[0.225,0.125,"you"],[0.35,0.438,"worship"],[0.8,0.675,"reveals"],[1.488,0.113,"your"],[1.613,0.225,"inner"],[1.85,0.425,"state"],[2.675,0.087,"And"],[2.763,0.138,"what"],[2.9,0.138,"you"],[3.038,0.287,"keep"],[3.337,0.713,"contemplating"],[4.062,0.125,"with"],[4.188,0.625,"faith"],[5.237,0.125,"you"],[5.362,0.5,"become"]]},{"s":"A","start":302.736,"end":309.12,"text":"Lesson two: food, sacrifice, austerity and charity each come in three modes.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.087,0.35,"Lesson"],[0.438,0.325,"two"],[1.275,0.375,"food"],[2.075,0.738,"sacrifice"],[3.038,0.662,"austerity"],[3.712,0.188,"and"],[3.913,0.5,"charity"],[4.425,0.2,"each"],[4.638,0.312,"come"],[4.963,0.15,"in"],[5.125,0.312,"three"],[5.45,0.562,"modes"]]},{"s":"B","start":309.408,"end":319.752,"text":"Goodness: nourishing food, duty-based service, sincere discipline, and giving at the right time and place to a worthy person, with no expectation.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.1,0.637,"Goodness"],[1.2,0.512,"nourishing"],[1.712,0.55,"food"],[2.513,0.537,"duty-based"],[3.05,0.637,"service"],[3.862,0.65,"sincere"],[4.525,0.575,"discipline"],[5.513,0.075,"and"],[5.588,0.275,"giving"],[5.862,0.05,"at"],[5.925,0.087,"the"],[6.013,0.338,"right"],[6.362,0.325,"time"],[6.7,0.075,"and"],[6.775,0.512,"place"],[7.287,0.138,"to"],[7.425,0.087,"a"],[7.513,0.425,"worthy"],[7.938,0.487,"person"],[8.787,0.138,"with"],[8.925,0.312,"no"],[9.238,0.738,"expectation"]]},{"s":"A","start":320.04,"end":335.256,"text":"Passion: stimulating food, showy worship, self-promoting discipline, conditional giving. Ignorance: stale food, ritual without faith, self-torture, disrespectful giving. Every act takes on the color of the mode behind it.","L":["L2"],"words":[[0.087,0.512,"Passion"],[1.05,0.55,"stimulating"],[1.613,0.388,"food"],[2.225,0.325,"showy"],[2.562,0.475,"worship"],[3.25,0.762,"self-promoting"],[4.025,0.537,"discipline"],[4.625,0.537,"conditional"],[5.175,0.425,"giving"],[6.0,0.55,"Ignorance"],[7.0,0.362,"stale"],[7.375,0.388,"food"],[8.225,0.388,"ritual"],[8.613,0.312,"without"],[8.938,0.412,"faith"],[9.738,0.775,"self-torture"],[10.713,0.713,"disrespectful"],[11.438,0.412,"giving"],[12.238,0.287,"Every"],[12.537,0.388,"act"],[12.938,0.275,"takes"],[13.225,0.1,"on"],[13.338,0.062,"the"],[13.412,0.388,"color"],[13.812,0.087,"of"],[13.912,0.075,"the"],[14.0,0.25,"mode"],[14.262,0.412,"behind"],[14.675,0.188,"it"]]},{"s":"B","start":336.12,"end":342.216,"text":"Lesson three: austerity has three dimensions, deed, word and thought.","L":["L3"],"words":[[0.087,0.463,"Lesson"],[0.688,0.45,"three"],[1.675,0.588,"austerity"],[2.263,0.25,"has"],[2.525,0.388,"three"],[2.913,0.688,"dimensions"],[3.837,0.375,"deed"],[4.75,0.275,"word"],[5.025,0.1,"and"],[5.125,0.6,"thought"]]},{"s":"A","start":342.504,"end":357.768,"text":"Deed: purity, honesty, nonviolence, service to the wise. Word: truthful, kind, helpful speech. Thought: serenity, gentleness, self-control, a clean mind.","L":["L3"],"words":[[0.087,0.438,"Deed"],[1.087,0.512,"purity"],[2.1,0.588,"honesty"],[2.913,0.775,"nonviolence"],[4.088,0.438,"service"],[4.525,0.075,"to"],[4.612,0.113,"the"],[4.737,0.575,"wise"],[5.662,0.425,"Word"],[6.513,0.688,"truthful"],[7.412,0.487,"kind"],[8.287,0.375,"helpful"],[8.675,0.6,"speech"],[9.738,0.375,"Thought"],[10.65,0.675,"serenity"],[11.775,0.675,"gentleness"],[12.838,0.75,"self-control"],[13.975,0.037,"a"],[14.012,0.4,"clean"],[14.425,0.487,"mind"]]},{"s":"B","start":358.056,"end":365.52,"text":"All three together, sincerely, and without wanting credit. Discipline isn't punishment. It's refinement.","L":["L3"],"words":[[0.1,0.175,"All"],[0.275,0.375,"three"],[0.65,0.512,"together"],[1.55,0.938,"sincerely"],[2.75,0.113,"and"],[2.862,0.375,"without"],[3.237,0.263,"wanting"],[3.5,0.425,"credit"],[4.325,0.525,"Discipline"],[4.975,0.275,"isn't"],[5.25,0.55,"punishment"],[6.213,0.125,"It's"],[6.338,0.762,"refinement"]]},{"s":"A","start":366.384,"end":371.448,"text":"And lesson four: action without faith has no spiritual value.","L":["L4"],"words":[[0.1,0.25,"And"],[0.45,0.3,"lesson"],[0.75,0.338,"four"],[1.775,0.388,"action"],[2.175,0.325,"without"],[2.5,0.412,"faith"],[2.975,0.212,"has"],[3.2,0.3,"no"],[3.513,0.65,"spiritual"],[4.175,0.525,"value"]]},{"s":"B","start":371.736,"end":381.576,"text":"Any act, sacrifice, charity or discipline, done without faith, is Asat. It brings no benefit, here or hereafter.","L":["L4"],"words":[[0.087,0.237,"Any"],[0.338,0.438,"act"],[1.0,1.062,"sacrifice"],[2.263,0.537,"charity"],[2.812,0.175,"or"],[3.0,0.637,"discipline"],[4.088,0.2,"done"],[4.287,0.35,"without"],[4.638,0.6,"faith"],[5.5,0.15,"is"],[5.65,0.588,"Asat"],[6.638,0.05,"It"],[6.688,0.212,"brings"],[6.9,0.225,"no"],[7.125,0.537,"benefit"],[8.088,0.362,"here"],[8.65,0.113,"or"],[8.775,0.713,"hereafter"]]},{"s":"A","start":381.864,"end":387.0,"text":"Faith isn't optional. It's what turns an outer action into a living offering.","L":["L4"],"words":[[0.175,0.312,"Faith"],[0.562,0.237,"isn't"],[0.812,0.562,"optional"],[1.75,0.138,"It's"],[1.887,0.2,"what"],[2.1,0.312,"turns"],[2.425,0.15,"an"],[2.638,0.338,"outer"],[2.987,0.425,"action"],[3.425,0.35,"into"],[3.788,0.075,"a"],[3.875,0.35,"living"],[4.237,0.537,"offering"]]},{"s":"B","start":387.864,"end":398.712,"text":"So, Chapter Seventeen. Faith, food, service, discipline and giving all come in three flavors, and faith is what gives any of it value.","L":["L1","L2","L4"],"words":[[0.1,0.475,"So"],[0.812,0.412,"Chapter"],[1.225,0.675,"Seventeen"],[2.337,0.475,"Faith"],[3.025,0.575,"food"],[3.875,0.675,"service"],[4.725,0.613,"discipline"],[5.525,0.125,"and"],[5.65,0.362,"giving"],[6.025,0.237,"all"],[6.263,0.237,"come"],[6.5,0.15,"in"],[6.65,0.45,"three"],[7.1,0.738,"flavors"],[8.2,0.125,"and"],[8.325,0.487,"faith"],[9.037,0.113,"is"],[9.15,0.163,"what"],[9.312,0.312,"gives"],[9.637,0.237,"any"],[9.875,0.062,"of"],[9.938,0.062,"it"],[10.0,0.487,"value"]]},{"s":"A","start":399.0,"end":407.544,"text":"Four lessons: you are your faith, everything in three modes, deed, word and thought, and without faith, nothing.","L":["L1","L2","L3","L4"],"words":[[0.087,0.1,"Four"],[0.188,0.562,"lessons"],[1.238,0.113,"you"],[1.363,0.125,"are"],[1.5,0.138,"your"],[1.65,0.4,"faith"],[2.525,0.537,"everything"],[3.075,0.175,"in"],[3.263,0.3,"three"],[3.562,0.5,"modes"],[4.438,0.388,"deed"],[5.287,0.35,"word"],[5.65,0.175,"and"],[5.838,0.388,"thought"],[6.475,0.125,"and"],[6.612,0.338,"without"],[6.95,0.463,"faith"],[7.625,0.575,"nothing"]]},{"s":"B","start":407.832,"end":416.736,"text":"Next time, the final chapter, Eighteen: liberation through renunciation, and Arjuna's answer. Thanks for listening to Shruti.","L":[],"words":[[0.087,0.2,"Next"],[0.287,0.412,"time"],[1.125,0.075,"the"],[1.2,0.312,"final"],[1.525,0.55,"chapter"],[2.538,0.45,"Eighteen"],[3.513,0.65,"liberation"],[4.175,0.212,"through"],[4.388,0.887,"renunciation"],[5.675,0.05,"and"],[5.725,0.463,"Arjuna's"],[6.2,0.5,"answer"],[7.1,0.138,"Thanks"],[7.237,0.113,"for"],[7.35,0.512,"listening"],[7.875,0.113,"to"],[7.987,0.537,"Shruti"]]}]}